## Cross-Cutting C++26 Standards

| Area | Standard |
|------|----------|
| Error Handling | `std::expected<T, E>` |
| Resource Management | RAII, `std::unique_ptr<Deleter>` |
| Concurrency | `std::scoped_lock`, `std::jthread` |
| Algorithms | `std::ranges`, `std::views` |
| Formatting | `std::format`, `std::print` (where available) |
| Build | Single C++26 across all targets |

