# Developer Getting Started Guide

## 🚀 Quick Start for Developers

This guide provides everything you need to start developing with PsiForceDB, from installation to your first database operations using the revolutionary PFQL query language.

## 📋 Prerequisites

### System Requirements
- **Operating System**: Windows 10/11, Linux (Ubuntu 20.04+, CentOS 8+), or macOS 10.15+
- **Memory**: Minimum 8GB RAM (16GB recommended)
- **Storage**: 50GB free disk space (SSD recommended)
- **Network**: 1Gbps network connectivity
- **Security**: TPM 2.0 support (recommended)

### Development Tools
- **C++ Compiler**: GCC 11+, Clang 14+, or MSVC 2022+
- **Build System**: CMake 3.20+
- **Package Manager**: Conan, vcpkg, or system package manager
- **IDE**: Visual Studio, CLion, or VS Code with C++ extensions

## 🛠️ Installation

### Windows Installation
```powershell
# Download installer
Invoke-WebRequest -Uri "https://downloads.psiforcedb.com/latest/windows" -OutFile "PsiForceDB-1.0.0.exe"

# Run installer with developer options
.\PsiForceDB-1.0.0.exe /DEVELOPER /SILENT
