## ⚡ Query Optimization

### Cost-Based Optimization

The query optimizer uses a sophisticated cost model to determine the most efficient execution plan for each query.

#### Cost Model Components

```cpp
class CostModel {
private:
    double cpuCostPerOperation = 1.0;
    double ioCostPerPage = 10.0;
    double networkCostPerByte = 0.1;

public:
    double calculateCost(const ExecutionPlan& plan) {
        double totalCost = 0.0;

        // CPU cost
        totalCost += plan.getOperationCount() * cpuCostPerOperation;

        // I/O cost
        totalCost += plan.getPageAccessCount() * ioCostPerPage;

        // Network cost (for distributed queries)
        totalCost += plan.getNetworkTraffic() * networkCostPerByte;

        return totalCost;
    }
};
```

