## 🔐 Security Architecture Overview

The PsiForceDB security architecture is built on a **Zero Trust** model with **Defense in Depth** principles, implementing multiple layers of protection to ensure comprehensive security coverage. This revolutionary framework combines traditional security measures with cutting-edge quantum-resistant cryptography and AI-powered threat detection.

### Security Philosophy

#### Zero Trust Model
Every interaction within and outside the system is treated as potentially malicious until proven otherwise. This approach eliminates the concept of a trusted network perimeter and requires continuous verification of all entities.

#### Defense in Depth
Multiple layers of security controls are implemented throughout the IT system to provide redundancy in case of a security breach. No single point of failure can compromise the entire system.

#### Proactive Security
Rather than simply reacting to threats, the security architecture actively anticipates and prevents attacks using AI-powered threat intelligence and behavioral analysis.

