# GIF3D Modular Quantum Engine

## Pure C++ Ground-Up Development

A revolutionary 3D graphics engine built from scratch using pure C++ with JavaScript bindings, featuring a modular plugin architecture, quantum algorithms, and advanced rendering capabilities.

## 🚀 Features

### Core Architecture
- **Pure C++ Implementation** - No third-party dependencies
- **Modular Design** - Pluggable modules for different functionalities
- **Plugin System** - Extensible architecture for custom features
- **Ground-Up Development** - Built from scratch, no external libraries

### Core Modules

#### 🎨 Rendering Module (`gif3d-rendering.js`)
- 3D transformation and projection
- Camera management
- Wireframe and solid rendering
- Basic lighting calculations
- Performance monitoring

#### 🧬 Quantum Module (`gif3d-quantum.js`)
- Quantum state simulation
- Quantum algorithms (Grover, Shor, QFT, VQE)
- Quantum gates implementation
- Qubit management
- Coherence simulation

#### 🎯 Shader Module (`gif3d-shader.js`)
- Custom shader programs
- Material system
- Post-processing effects
- Shader compilation simulation
- Multi-pass rendering

#### 🌑 Shadow Module (`gif3d-shadow.js`)
- Shadow mapping
- Multiple light sources
- Cascaded shadow maps
- Soft shadows (PCF, PCSS)
- Advanced lighting

#### 🌈 Color Module (`gif3d-color.js`)
- Color palettes and gradients
- Color correction
- Color space conversions
- Animated color effects
- Color harmonies

### Plugin System

#### 🔌 Built-in Plugins
- **Quantum Visualizer** - Real-time quantum particle effects
- **Physics Simulator** - Rigid body physics with collision detection
- **Audio Visualizer** - Real-time audio frequency visualization

