#### Discovery 1: Immutable Audit Trail Required for All Junction Operations
**Date**: 2025-11-18
**Discovered By**: Team 2 (Purple Pages Data Governance)
**Finding**:
```
Junction Manager must integrate with pp_audit_logs table for 7-year immutable audit trail.
Every DLL load/unload, junction creation/removal, and routing operation must be logged
with full context (user, IP, timestamp, before/after state) for GDPR compliance.

Current spec has NO audit logging - this is a critical compliance gap.
```

**Impact**:
- [X] Requires specification change
- [X] Requires implementation change
- [X] Requires architecture change
- [X] Requires additional testing

**Amendment Required**:
```
Junction Manager MUST use AuditLogger class from:
C:\McMaker Projects\Projects\LamiaFabrica\Back-Office\PsiForceDB_1.0.0\src\api_gateway\security\audit_logger.hpp

All operations must be logged to pp_audit_logs table with:
- audit_uuid (unique identifier)
- user_id and username (who triggered the operation)
- action_type (new types needed: DLL_LOADED, DLL_UNLOADED, JUNCTION_CREATED, etc.)
- resource_type = "junction" or "dll"
- resource_id (junction name or DLL path)
- ip_address (origin of request)
- action_details (JSON with full context)
- before_value and after_value (state snapshots for rollback)
- compliance_category = SYSTEM_CONFIG_CHANGED or SECURITY
```

**Recommended Changes**:
```cpp
#include "../../McMaker Projects/Projects/LamiaFabrica/Back-Office/PsiForceDB_1.0.0/src/api_gateway/security/audit_logger.hpp"

namespace MedusaServ {
namespace Junction {

class JunctionManager : public IJunctionManager {
private:
    std::shared_ptr<psiforcedb::security::AuditLogger> audit_logger_;
    std::shared_ptr<mysql::Connection> db_connection_;

public:
    JunctionManager(std::shared_ptr<mysql::Connection> db_conn)
        : db_connection_(db_conn),
          audit_logger_(std::make_shared<psiforcedb::security::AuditLogger>(db_conn)) {}

    bool createJunction(
        const std::string& dll_path,
        const std::string& junction_name,
        JunctionType type,
        int user_id,
        const std::string& username,
        const std::string& ip_address
    ) override {
        // Capture before state
        std::string before_state = "{}"; // No junction exists yet

        // Create junction
        bool success = createJunctionInternal(dll_path, junction_name, type);

        // Capture after state
        std::ostringstream after_state;
        after_state << "{\"junction_name\":\"" << junction_name << "\","
                    << "\"dll_path\":\"" << dll_path << "\","
                    << "\"type\":\"" << junctionTypeToString(type) << "\"}";

        // Log to immutable audit trail
        audit_logger_->logEventDetailed(
            user_id,
            username,
            "SYSTEM",
            psiforcedb::security::AuditActionType::SYSTEM_CONFIG_CHANGED,
            "junction",
            junction_name,
            ip_address,
            "",
            "{\"action\":\"junction_created\",\"dll_path\":\"" + dll_path + "\"}",
            before_state,
            after_state.str(),
            psiforcedb::security::ComplianceCategory::SECURITY
        );

        return success;
    }

    bool removeJunction(
        const std::string& junction_name,
        int user_id,
        const std::string& username,
        const std::string& ip_address
    ) override {
        // Capture before state (current junction configuration)
        JunctionInfo info = getJunctionInfo(junction_name);
        std::ostringstream before_state;
        before_state << "{\"junction_name\":\"" << info.name << "\","
                     << "\"dll_path\":\"" << info.dll_path << "\","
                     << "\"type\":\"" << junctionTypeToString(info.type) << "\"}";

        // Remove junction
        bool success = removeJunctionInternal(junction_name);

        // Log removal
        audit_logger_->logEventDetailed(
            user_id,
            username,
            "SYSTEM",
            psiforcedb::security::AuditActionType::SYSTEM_CONFIG_CHANGED,
            "junction",
            junction_name,
            ip_address,
            "",
            "{\"action\":\"junction_removed\"}",
            before_state.str(),
            "{}", // No junction after removal
            psiforcedb::security::ComplianceCategory::SECURITY
        );

        return success;
    }
};

} // namespace Junction
} // namespace MedusaServ
