#### Discovery 2: RBAC Integration Required for Junction Access Control
**Date**: 2025-11-18
**Discovered By**: Team 2 (Purple Pages Security)
**Finding**:
```
Junction Manager operations are SYSTEM-level operations that should only be accessible
to high-privilege users (ADMIN, ROOT, GOD_MODE). Current spec has NO access control.

Purple Pages has 6-level RBAC system:
- PUBLIC (Level 0) - NO junction access
- LICENSED (Level 100) - NO junction access
- DEVELOPER (Level 500) - Read-only junction info
- ADMIN (Level 800) - Can create/remove junctions
- ROOT (Level 900) - Full junction control
- GOD_MODE (Level 999) - Full junction control + audit bypass

Junction Manager must check pp_roles table before allowing operations.
```

**Impact**:
- [X] Requires specification change
- [X] Requires implementation change
- [X] Requires architecture change
- [X] Requires additional testing

**Amendment Required**:
```
Junction Manager must integrate with pp_roles and pp_users tables to verify
user permissions before allowing junction operations.

Required permission levels:
- listJunctions() - Requires role_level >= 500 (DEVELOPER)
- getJunctionInfo() - Requires role_level >= 500 (DEVELOPER)
- createJunction() - Requires role_level >= 800 (ADMIN) AND can_manage_system_config = TRUE
- removeJunction() - Requires role_level >= 800 (ADMIN) AND can_manage_system_config = TRUE
- loadLibrary() - Requires role_level >= 800 (ADMIN) AND can_upload_updates = TRUE
- unloadLibrary() - Requires role_level >= 800 (ADMIN) AND can_upload_updates = TRUE
```

**Recommended Changes**:
```cpp
class JunctionManager : public IJunctionManager {
private:
    std::shared_ptr<mysql::Connection> db_connection_;

    // Verify user has required role level
    bool verifyRoleLevel(int user_id, int required_level) {
        auto pstmt = db_connection_->prepareStatement(
            "SELECT r.role_level FROM pp_users u "
            "JOIN pp_roles r ON u.role_id = r.role_id "
            "WHERE u.user_id = ?"
        );
        pstmt->setInt(1, user_id);
        auto res = pstmt->executeQuery();

        if (res->next()) {
            return res->getInt("role_level") >= required_level;
        }
        return false;
    }

    // Verify user has specific permission
    bool verifyPermission(int user_id, const std::string& permission) {
        auto pstmt = db_connection_->prepareStatement(
            "SELECT r." + permission + " FROM pp_users u "
            "JOIN pp_roles r ON u.role_id = r.role_id "
            "WHERE u.user_id = ?"
        );
        pstmt->setInt(1, user_id);
        auto res = pstmt->executeQuery();

        if (res->next()) {
            return res->getBoolean(permission);
        }
        return false;
    }

public:
    bool createJunction(
        const std::string& dll_path,
        const std::string& junction_name,
        JunctionType type,
        int user_id,
        const std::string& username,
        const std::string& ip_address
    ) override {
        // RBAC Check
        if (!verifyRoleLevel(user_id, 800)) {
            audit_logger_->logEventDetailed(
                user_id, username, "",
                psiforcedb::security::AuditActionType::PERMISSION_DENIED,
                "junction", junction_name, ip_address, "",
                "{\"error\":\"Insufficient role level\",\"required\":800}",
                "", "",
                psiforcedb::security::ComplianceCategory::ACCESS_CONTROL
            );
            throw std::runtime_error("Insufficient privileges - ADMIN role required");
        }

        if (!verifyPermission(user_id, "can_manage_system_config")) {
            audit_logger_->logEventDetailed(
                user_id, username, "",
                psiforcedb::security::AuditActionType::PERMISSION_DENIED,
                "junction", junction_name, ip_address, "",
                "{\"error\":\"Missing can_manage_system_config permission\"}",
                "", "",
                psiforcedb::security::ComplianceCategory::ACCESS_CONTROL
            );
            throw std::runtime_error("Missing can_manage_system_config permission");
        }

        // Proceed with junction creation...
    }
};
