                                    const std::vector<uint8_t>& salt,
                                    size_t key_length = 32);
    bool verifyHardwareBinding(const HardwareFingerprint& stored);
};
```

Key derivation uses:
- Argon2id with 64MB memory, 3 iterations, 4 threads
- Hardware fingerprint (CPU, motherboard, MAC addresses, disk serials)
- 60% component match required for authorization

