## Troubleshooting

### Hardware Mismatch
```
[PSMDB] Hardware binding mismatch - PSMDB locked to different hardware
[PSMDB] Use recovery key to unlock or migrate to new hardware
```
**Solution**: Use recovery key or restore from backup on new hardware.

### Dome Not Found
```
[PSMDB] Creating new PSMDB Dome at: ~/.psiforcedb/psmdb.dome
```
**Info**: This is normal on first run. Dome will be created automatically.

### Migration Failed
```
[PSMDB] Migration failed
```
**Solution**: Check legacy path permissions and disk space.

