## Purple Pages Request API - Full Argument Specifications

### Request Structure

```cpp
struct PurplePagesRequest {
    RequestType type;                                   // Required: Request type
    std::string requestId;                              // Required: Unique request ID
    std::string userId;                                 // Required: User ID for audit trail
    std::map<std::string, std::string> parameters;      // Optional: Request parameters
    std::string payload;                                // Optional: Request payload
    bool requiresCallback;                              // Optional: Callback required?
    std::string callbackUrl;                            // Optional: Callback URL
};
```

### Response Structure

```cpp
struct PurplePagesResponse {
    std::string requestId;                              // Matches request ID
    bool success;                                       // true if successful
    std::string data;                                   // Response data
    std::string error;                                  // Error message (if failed)
    std::map<std::string, std::string> metadata;        // Response metadata
    double processingTimeMs;                            // Processing time in milliseconds
};
```

