## Integration with Infrastructure Hub

### Factory Pattern

Use the factory to create and register the processor:

```cpp
// Create processor
auto processor = PurplePagesProcessorFactory::createProcessor(infrastructureHub);

// Register with Infrastructure Hub
bool registered = PurplePagesProcessorFactory::registerWithHub(
    infrastructureHub,
    processor.get()
);

if (registered) {
    processor->start();
}
```

### Handler Registration

Register custom handlers for specific request types:

```cpp
// Register custom marketplace query handler
processor->registerRequestHandler(
    RequestType::MARKETPLACE_QUERY,
    [](const PurplePagesRequest& request) -> PurplePagesResponse {
        PurplePagesResponse response;
        response.requestId = request.requestId;
        response.success = true;

        // Custom marketplace logic here
        response.data = performMarketplaceSearch(request.parameters);

        return response;
    }
);
```

